id: steaming-fury
name: Steaming Fury
order: 17
category: body
importance: secondary
# (1) The Obscured Environmental Quality not felt (registry.mjs qualityPrograms).
ignoresQualities: obscured
description: >
  With your hair-trigger temper, you can spout steam from your body whenever you get angry.
text: >
  Steaming Fury (Body): With your hair-trigger temper, you can spout steam from your body whenever you get angry.
  (1)-[Passive]: Ignore the effects of the Obscured Environmental Quality.
  (2)-[Triggered/Raging]: All Squares within a Standard Sphere AoE (centered on you) gain the Obscured Environmental Quality until the end of your next turn.
  (3)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Round, 3/Encounter]: Enter the Raging State until the end of your next turn.

---

# (2) Entering the Raging State - asked in its window: you and whoever your player targets in the Sphere get the Smoked
# mark, their Square Obscured, till the end of your next turn - the Smoke Bomb's arrangement. Which Squares, the table's.
[triggered/state/raging, chosen, effect 2]
steamCloud();

# (3) The Power Up's window: Raging till the end of your next turn - and (2) asked as it is entered.
[triggered/power, 1/round, 3/encounter, effect 3]
enterState(raging, 1, next-turn);
